{% comment %}
  Doomlings Score Tool — app block.
  Add to a page template (e.g. /pages/score) via the theme editor.
  Talks to the DML Score app through the app proxy at /apps/score.
{% endcomment %}

{{ 'dmls-score.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}

<div id="dmls-root"
  data-heading="{{ block.settings.heading | escape }}">

  {% comment %}
    The gameplay itself (Add Names through the winner reveal, plus the
    Achievements/History view) renders inside a #dmls-modal overlay that
    dmls-score.js appends to document.body at boot. This on-page element is
    the welcome screen, rendered statically here by renderPageWelcome() in
    dmls-score.js — its Start scoring/Resume it buttons open the modal
    directly onto Add Names (or a resumed screen), with no separate welcome
    step inside the modal.
  {% endcomment %}
  <div class="dmls-launcher" id="dmls-welcome-page"></div>

  {% comment %}
    The recommended-products widget used to be rendered here directly from a
    `collection`-type block setting. That setting (and show_products/
    products_heading/products_note alongside it) moved into the app's own
    Settings → Products page (Admin GraphQL-backed collection picker) so it
    doesn't require the theme editor to change — Liquid has no way to read
    that app-side config at render time, so renderProducts() in dmls-score.js
    populates this container client-side from /apps/score/config once it
    resolves, same pattern as #dmls-welcome-page above.
  {% endcomment %}
  <div id="dmls-products" hidden></div>
</div>

<script>
  window.DMLS_CONFIG = {
    proxyBase: "/apps/score",
    customer: {% if customer %}{ id: {{ customer.id | json }}, firstName: {{ customer.first_name | default: "" | json | replace: '/', '\/' }} }{% else %}null{% endif %},
    assets: {
      winner: "{{ 'dmls-winner.png' | asset_url }}"
    }
  };
</script>
<script src="{{ 'dmls-score.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Doomlings Score Tool",
  "target": "section",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "heading",
      "label": "Welcome heading",
      "default": "Ready to see who won the game?"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
